            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Weft 1.0.57

- Automatically restore services that were running when Weft quits, after reopening the app.
- Restore each workspace independently using its existing ports, routing configuration and task claim.
- Keep stopped services stopped and report restoration failures for review.

Requires macOS 26 or later and Apple silicon. Versions through 1.0.52 require one manual installation to enable in-app updates.
]]></description>
